{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜美股下挫　道指跌逾1000點／習近平形容中俄美會談具開創性意義\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-US-WALLST-261120A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月20日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【美股下挫】美股3大指數下挫，道指跌超過一千點，跌穿五萬點關口。</p><p>【世紀會談】中俄美元首三方會晤，習近平形容具有開創性意義，大國良性互動是必答題。</p><p>【志願聯盟峰會】歐洲援烏志願聯盟召開峰會，重申任何有關俄烏談判，不能排除歐洲與烏克蘭。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.486540+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:16:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:37:50.554737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:31.977455+00:00","content_hash":"a0116690d8227cb42c5736cdd7fc0a50333f29e47e2df3a3169cb4d6277b2606","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}